**Title:** Whispering Waves: A Gentle Journey with Kai and Mira

**Description:** Embark on a tranquil journey with Kai, an 11-year-old boy filled with gentle curiosity, as he explores the serene coastal shoreline alongside his wise sea turtle companion, Mira. In a world painted with the golden hues of a setting sun and the soothing whispers of lapping waves, Kai discovers the quiet power of patience and acceptance. Each moment spent on this enchanting seascape encourages a deep sense of emotional calm, weaving a narrative where the rhythm of the ocean nurtures a peaceful mind ready for sleep. This calming audio is crafted to ease anxieties and guide you effortlessly into a restful slumber.

